[{"id":"cnm_059_q1","topicId":"cnm_059","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"50° 角的余角和补角各是多少？（依次作答，用逗号隔开，单位：度）","answer":"40，130","explanation":"余角：90°-50°=40°；补角：180°-50°=130°。","verify":"[90-50, 180-50]"},{"id":"cnm_059_q2","topicId":"cnm_059","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下列各组角中，互为余角的是","answer":"B","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"45° 和 135°"},{"key":"B","text":"30° 和 60°"},{"key":"C","text":"100° 和 80°"},{"key":"D","text":"20° 和 80°"}],"explanation":"和为 90° 的两个角互为余角，30°+60°=90°；45°+135° 与 100°+80° 都是 180°，互为补角；20°+80°=100°。"},{"id":"cnm_059_q3","topicId":"cnm_059","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个角的补角是 120°，这个角的余角是多少度？","answer":"30","explanation":"这个角为 180°-120°=60°，它的余角为 90°-60°=30°。","verify":"90-(180-120)"},{"id":"cnm_059_q4","topicId":"cnm_059","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"∠α=25°18′，则 ∠α 的余角是 a°b′，依次填 a、b，用逗号隔开。","answer":"64，42","explanation":"余角=90°-25°18′=89°60′-25°18′=64°42′。","verify":"[(90*60-(25*60+18))//60, (90*60-(25*60+18))%60]"},{"id":"cnm_059_q5","topicId":"cnm_059","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个角的补角是它的余角的 3 倍，这个角是多少度？","answer":"45","explanation":"设这个角为 x°，则 180-x=3(90-x)，解得 x=45。","verify":"Fraction(3*90-180,3-1)"},{"id":"cnm_060_q1","topicId":"cnm_060","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"若 ∠1+∠2=90°，∠1+∠3=90°，则 ∠2 与 ∠3 的关系？为什么？","answer":"C","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"∠2=∠3，因为同角的补角相等"},{"key":"B","text":"∠2+∠3=180°，因为互为补角"},{"key":"C","text":"∠2=∠3，因为同角的余角相等"},{"key":"D","text":"无法确定它们的关系"}],"explanation":"∠2 与 ∠3 都是 ∠1 的余角，所以 ∠2=90°-∠1=∠3，依据是“同角的余角相等”。"},{"id":"cnm_060_q2","topicId":"cnm_060","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"∠α=∠β，∠α=55°，则 ∠β 的余角是多少度？","answer":"35","explanation":"∠β=∠α=55°，它的余角是 90°-55°=35°（也就是等角的余角相等）。","verify":"90-55"},{"id":"cnm_060_q3","topicId":"cnm_060","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"∠1 与 ∠2 互补，∠3 与 ∠2 互补，∠1=40°，则 ∠3 是多少度？","answer":"40","explanation":"∠2=180°-40°=140°，∠3=180°-140°=40°；也可直接由“同角的补角相等”得 ∠3=∠1=40°。","verify":"180-(180-40)"},{"id":"cnm_060_q4","topicId":"cnm_060","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"下列推理中，正确的是","answer":"A","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"因为 ∠1 与 ∠2 互补，∠2 与 ∠3 互补，所以 ∠1=∠3"},{"key":"B","text":"因为 ∠1+∠2=90°，∠3+∠4=90°，所以 ∠1=∠3"},{"key":"C","text":"因为 ∠1+∠2=90°，∠2+∠3=180°，所以 ∠1=∠3"},{"key":"D","text":"因为 ∠1 与 ∠2 互余，∠3 与 ∠4 互补，∠2=∠4，所以 ∠1=∠3"}],"explanation":"∠1、∠3 都是 ∠2 的补角，由“同角的补角相等”得 ∠1=∠3；其他选项中角的和不同或没有共同的（或相等的）角，不能得出结论。"},{"id":"cnm_060_q5","topicId":"cnm_060","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"∠1+∠2=180°，∠2+∠3=180°，且 ∠1=2x+10°，∠3=3x-20°，求 x 的值。","answer":"30","explanation":"同角的补角相等，所以 ∠1=∠3，即 2x+10=3x-20，解得 x=30。","verify":"(10+20)//(3-2)"}]
